 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All five kinds kept. Cassette deck: 21 models cut to 14 plus 7 archetypes (dropped Akai HX-A3, B&O Beocord 3500, Pioneer CT-939, Rotel RD-15F, Technics RS-263US/RS-288, Nakamichi 670 ZX as near-duplicates); head count, NR and auto-reverse as types. Reel-to-reel gains archetypes (old kind had no models). Left out (no retrieved page naming them): Nakamichi CR-7/ZX-7 years, Aiwa and Sony TC-K archetypes, Technics RS-B, Studer A810, TEAC X-2000, Technics RS-1500/1700, Tandberg 9000X, Otari, Sony MDS-JA555ES/JB980, Sony DTC-ZA5ES, Pioneer D-07, Akai/Panasonic 8-track players (8-track article names no home players)."
